  "bio": "Matty Magee is renowned for their exceptional skill in the traditional tattoo style, a craft they have honed to perfection in the bustling city of London, United Kingdom. Clients flock to Two Snakes Tattoo and The Blue Tattoo London on appointed days to experience the meticulous precision of Matty's work. This testament to their artistry is coupled with stringent cleanliness, ensuring a safe and pristine environment for every tattoo session.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: London, England, United Kingdom"
